  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.71,
      "end_seconds": 2.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "morning, come on through"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.77,
      "end_seconds": 5.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Hi there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 6.75,
      "end_seconds": 11.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.07,
      "end_seconds": 19.04,
      "duration_seconds": 6.97,
      "text": "right, absolutely, come and and sit beside them. So what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.33,
      "end_seconds": 29.66,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "I've been getting out of breath, and I wanted to get it checked"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.23,
      "end_seconds": 32.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.39,
      "end_seconds": 38.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "I take ramipril 5 milligrams every morning for my blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 40.97,
      "end_seconds": 51.6,
      "duration_seconds": 10.63,
      "text": "right, doctor, I think the last prescription for the ramipril was 2.5 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.01,
      "end_seconds": 57.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "hm do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.49,
      "end_seconds": 78.76,
      "duration_seconds": 20.27,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. Foracort inhaler, twice a day for my asthma. I didn't wanna bother you but it keeps coming back. Yeah, it's tamsulosin, 0.4 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 79.37,
      "end_seconds": 85.4,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "so that's what's prescribed but I'm not sure he takes it every day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.41,
      "end_seconds": 93.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.43,
      "text": "how long has this been bothering you? These questions might sound routine, but they matter"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.39,
      "end_seconds": 102.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.75,
      "text": "actually, I'd say about four days actually, no, closer to ten days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.23,
      "end_seconds": 113.45,
      "duration_seconds": 9.22,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.55,
      "end_seconds": 124.59,
      "duration_seconds": 10.04,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, it feels severe to me i notice it more with stairs"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.05,
      "end_seconds": 134.08,
      "duration_seconds": 9.03,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 134.18,
      "end_seconds": 141.76,
      "duration_seconds": 7.58,
      "text": "hmm, tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.77,
      "end_seconds": 165.64,
      "duration_seconds": 22.87,
      "text": "I was getting to that! I've also been putting on weight over the years, for about a month. Okay, so I've also had sore knees. As for sore knees, it happens every other day. Yes, walking. That makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.69,
      "end_seconds": 181.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any chest pain, low mood, palpitations or high thirst?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.25,
      "end_seconds": 199.25,
      "duration_seconds": 17.0,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, no, no chest pain, no low mood, no palpitations i was snoring at one point, but that went away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.03,
      "end_seconds": 203.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.3,
      "end_seconds": 209.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Okay, so that's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.12,
      "end_seconds": 216.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "right, any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.04,
      "end_seconds": 219.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "yeah, no, all normal there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.47,
      "end_seconds": 224.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.85,
      "end_seconds": 231.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "I I had my tonsils removed as a teenager"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.94,
      "end_seconds": 242.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "so, do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.91,
      "end_seconds": 247.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.4,
      "end_seconds": 251.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.48,
      "end_seconds": 256.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.69,
      "end_seconds": 262.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.29,
      "end_seconds": 270.62,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "My father had bowel cancer. My mother had a a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.85,
      "end_seconds": 274.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.36,
      "end_seconds": 283.55,
      "duration_seconds": 8.19,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure, for about a year i've never really been one for hospitals"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.34,
      "end_seconds": 285.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "is that everything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.48,
      "end_seconds": 297.69,
      "duration_seconds": 10.21,
      "text": "yes asthma. Yes an enlarged prostate. I looked a few things up online and that probably didn't help"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.5,
      "end_seconds": 303.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.4,
      "end_seconds": 307.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "no I'm not allergic to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 308.47,
      "end_seconds": 318.94,
      "duration_seconds": 10.47,
      "text": "actually, you know, I remember he had some kind of reaction to amoxicillin before. I couldn't swear to it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.32,
      "end_seconds": 326.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "I don't remember that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.67,
      "end_seconds": 334.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "okay, I'll note both of those let me get the readings out of the way"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.09,
      "end_seconds": 346.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "that's it just a little longer.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.42,
      "end_seconds": 375.43,
      "duration_seconds": 15.01,
      "text": "okay: blood pressure 147 over 89, weight 87 kilos and height 162 centimetres, heart rate 94, BMI works out to to 33.2, temperature 36.5, SpO2 99 percent on room air"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.18,
      "end_seconds": 381.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "let me look at the area, I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 383.45,
      "end_seconds": 384.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.75,
      "end_seconds": 387.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "look straight ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 395.03,
      "end_seconds": 400.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Your weight and waist measurement are both above the healthy range."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 403.07,
      "end_seconds": 415.94,
      "duration_seconds": 12.87,
      "text": "that's all I needed to check. So, based on the history and the the examination, it points towards obesity with weight-related symptoms. We shouldn't forget an underactive thyroid"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 417.48,
      "end_seconds": 422.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Hmm I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 422.82,
      "end_seconds": 435.99,
      "duration_seconds": 13.17,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with obesity with weight-related symptoms do well once it's treated properly. I think a cholesterol test makes sense here, for obesity."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 437.18,
      "end_seconds": 438.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 440.33,
      "end_seconds": 464.1,
      "duration_seconds": 23.77,
      "text": "I want an HbA1c done, that's for obesity that will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step aim for a loss of half a kilo a week with smaller portions and a daily thirty-minute walk we'll refer you to the weight management service"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 464.88,
      "end_seconds": 469.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "um, sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 470.75,
      "end_seconds": 488.66,
      "duration_seconds": 17.91,
      "text": "and please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit so we can settle the dose come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse that's all from me any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 493.85,
      "end_seconds": 496.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "that's clear um thanks"
    }
  ]
}